[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18060.15, "timestamp": "05:01:00", "text": "是啊，事情就是这样。另外，让我来修复一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18062.75, "timestamp": "05:01:02", "text": "仅此一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18065.07, "timestamp": "05:01:05", "text": "一切都很大很大"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18067.99, "timestamp": "05:01:07", "text": "呃，我要把自己关在角落里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18087.03, "timestamp": "05:01:27", "text": "第一次尝试呃，死对头的比赛很暖和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18089.43, "timestamp": "05:01:29", "text": "向上。那场比赛已经结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18092.708, "timestamp": "05:01:32", "text": "哦，团队死亡竞赛。哦，是自动填充功能。能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18095.91, "timestamp": "05:01:35", "text": "我删除这个吗？我不想要人。如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18097.868, "timestamp": "05:01:37", "text": "我应该删除这个吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18101.39, "timestamp": "05:01:41", "text": "自动填充？如何移除"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18104.75, "timestamp": "05:01:44", "text": "自动填充？嗯，算是吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18108.07, "timestamp": "05:01:48", "text": "美好的。有办法的。是否有办法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18114.628, "timestamp": "05:01:54", "text": "语音聊天功能已禁用。好的，谢谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18119.43, "timestamp": "05:01:59", "text": "上帝。仅限团队。实际上没有。是的，我是"}]